      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you see in their eyes is likely a reflection of your own internal struggle, not a final judgment on you. Wanting to relieve their burden is a deeply selfless instinct, but true love doesn't require you to disappear. Instead of being an obstacle, you are a part of their history, and getting help is the way to change the dynamic. Please let someone else carry this weight with you; you don't have to do it alone.",
